		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Weapon Kit</strong> &middot; <em>Engineer invention. Counts as a weapon for swapping and stowing. Toolbelt options cost 2 Actions and 1 Toolbelt scrap.</em></p><hr><p><strong>Med Blaster (basic) &mdash; 1 Action.</strong> Reach 2. Target gains INT temp HP, 1 round. If they are Bloodied they regain HP instead.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt (2 Actions, 1 scrap):</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Vital Burst.</strong> Cone 2, Restore 2&times;INT HP.</li><li><strong>Cleansing Mist.</strong> Burst 2, Restore 1d4 HP. Targets heal 1 negative condition.</li><li><strong>Stim Pack.</strong> Reach 2. Ally gains +2 speed and +1 Max Actions on their next turn. They are Dazed for 1 turn at the end of the round.</li></ul><p><strong>High Levels:</strong> +2 bonus every 5 levels (Med Blaster, Vital Burst, Cleansing Mist).</p>",
